    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to VIA </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a medieval fantasy world full of strategic PvP battles without the need for grinding. In VIA Online, you choose your path as a Merchant, Guardian, or Thief\u2014your success depends on your gear, decisions and skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/b37f0a94737ca3c6a466983d1755d3ac.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your mastery of real-time combat in intense encounters where reflexes and tactics matter just as much as your character's strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ae973457d4a610404a24e99c829ea1fa.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ae973457d4a610404a24e99c829ea1fa.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ae973457d4a610404a24e99c829ea1fa.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/562111db92dff7c255a3be0b860865f6.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight</strong><br>Wield a massive two-handed sword and dominate in close combat with unparalleled defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ac72002bd7e4a73bf4ba8334f43c1a51.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ac72002bd7e4a73bf4ba8334f43c1a51.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ac72002bd7e4a73bf4ba8334f43c1a51.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard</strong><br>Manipulate arcane powers, unleashing devastating area-of-effect spells and magical shields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/916dd556fae041d19e2e1265812e164a.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/916dd556fae041d19e2e1265812e164a.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/916dd556fae041d19e2e1265812e164a.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer</strong><br>Utilize precision strikes and nature's powers to take down enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/6b043cb1e756004ebb49f156ea163773.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/690849c1d02f1eb607c7292c631d7a73.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of VIA is the Caravan System, where merchants transport valuable goods between towns. Thieves lie in wait to steal them, while Guardians protect the caravans. This balanced system offers high-stakes PvP where strategy and risk management are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d1694680e4f668ff0b17adb110ae97c5.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d1694680e4f668ff0b17adb110ae97c5.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d1694680e4f668ff0b17adb110ae97c5.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d2d522f1d6669323f16afe32df57ba87.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from the open world, hunt down rare monsters, and craft powerful items to help you in battle. With a rich crafting system, your progress feels meaningful as you grow stronger. Say goodbye to endless leveling. Instead, focus on improving your gear and upgrading your professions to increase your power and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/2c0eeed1a181332b98113b6726f86e57.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic encounters with legendary monsters, explore a vast open world, and discover hidden treasures in dangerous dungeons. Play solo or with friends, taking on group content or challenging PvP battles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to VIA </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a medieval fantasy world full of strategic PvP battles without the need for grinding. In VIA Online, you choose your path as a Merchant, Guardian, or Thief\u2014your success depends on your gear, decisions and skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/b37f0a94737ca3c6a466983d1755d3ac.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your mastery of real-time combat in intense encounters where reflexes and tactics matter just as much as your character's strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ae973457d4a610404a24e99c829ea1fa.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ae973457d4a610404a24e99c829ea1fa.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ae973457d4a610404a24e99c829ea1fa.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/562111db92dff7c255a3be0b860865f6.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight</strong><br>Wield a massive two-handed sword and dominate in close combat with unparalleled defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ac72002bd7e4a73bf4ba8334f43c1a51.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ac72002bd7e4a73bf4ba8334f43c1a51.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/ac72002bd7e4a73bf4ba8334f43c1a51.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard</strong><br>Manipulate arcane powers, unleashing devastating area-of-effect spells and magical shields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/916dd556fae041d19e2e1265812e164a.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/916dd556fae041d19e2e1265812e164a.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/916dd556fae041d19e2e1265812e164a.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer</strong><br>Utilize precision strikes and nature's powers to take down enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/6b043cb1e756004ebb49f156ea163773.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/690849c1d02f1eb607c7292c631d7a73.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of VIA is the Caravan System, where merchants transport valuable goods between towns. Thieves lie in wait to steal them, while Guardians protect the caravans. This balanced system offers high-stakes PvP where strategy and risk management are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d1694680e4f668ff0b17adb110ae97c5.poster.avif?t=1731253225\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d1694680e4f668ff0b17adb110ae97c5.webm?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d1694680e4f668ff0b17adb110ae97c5.mp4?t=1731253225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/d2d522f1d6669323f16afe32df57ba87.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from the open world, hunt down rare monsters, and craft powerful items to help you in battle. With a rich crafting system, your progress feels meaningful as you grow stronger. Say goodbye to endless leveling. Instead, focus on improving your gear and upgrading your professions to increase your power and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271330/extras/2c0eeed1a181332b98113b6726f86e57.avif?t=1731253225\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic encounters with legendary monsters, explore a vast open world, and discover hidden treasures in dangerous dungeons. Play solo or with friends, taking on group content or challenging PvP battles.</p>",
    "short_description": "VIA is a free-to-play MMORPG featuring third-person action combat focused on caravan-based PvP battles, where the risks you take equal your rewards. With a deep crafting system and no level grind, you access endgame content instantly, prioritizing professions that shape gameplay.",
